# Test that [macro name [let params] body] parses correctly.
# This is a parse-only test since macro expansion semantics are in the next sprint.
[macro double [let x] [quote [+ [unquote x] [unquote x]]]]
=== warn
undefined variable: x
=== out
[macro double [let x] [quote [+ [unquote x] [unquote x]]]]
